  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Evaluation and Monitoring Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will carry out impact evaluations of selected child labor interventions in Peru and in the Philippines, develop 4 comprehensive monitoring and evaluation plans, and implement 2 tracer studies. Tracer studies look retrospectively at the long term outcomes and impacts of project interventions on a specific population.</narrative>
  </description>
